  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 8 × 15 ÷ 3 + 14 − 4 = 26\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 15, 26​\n\nGiven statement : 8 × 15 ÷ 3 + 14 − 4 = 26\n\nAfter interchanging\n\n8 × **26 ÷ 3**__ + 14 − 4 = 15\n\n__**8 × **__**__8.67__** + 14 − 4 = 15\n\n__**69.36 + 14**__ - 4 = 15\n\n__**83.36 - 4**__ = 15\n\n79.36 ≠ 15 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 4, 8\n\nGiven statement : 8 × 15 ÷ 3 + 14 − 4 = 26\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n4 × **15 ÷ 3**__ + 14 − 8 = 26\n\n__**4 × **____5__ + 14 − 8 = 26\n\n**__20__**__** + 14**__ − 8 = 26\n\n__**34 - 8**__ = 26\n\n26 = 26 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 14, 15\n\nGiven statement : 8 × 15 ÷ 3 + 14 − 4 = 26\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n8 × **14 ÷ 3**__ + 15 − 4 = 26\n\n__**8 × **____4.67__ + 15 − 4 = 26\n\n__**37.36 + 15**__ - 4 = 26\n\n__**52.56 - 4**__ = 26\n\n48.56 ≠ 26 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 3, 4\n\nGiven statement : 8 × 15 ÷ 3 + 14 − 4 = 26\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n8 × **15 ÷ 4**__ + 14 − 3 = 26\n\n__**8 × **__**__3.75__** + 14 − 3 = 26\n\n__**30 + 14**__ - 3 = 26\n\n__**44 - 3**__ = 26\n\n41 ≠ 26 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
